msgid "Edit dangerous Q6 service startup script"
msgstr "编辑危险的 Q6 服务启动脚本"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:227
#: cd885b625d1a4a8c844b9dc3374b28d7
msgid ""
"On the flight board, edit /etc/init/q6.conf script and comment out the "
"line below which, if left in place, can cause the board to stall forever "
"during the boot up process is \"q6\" fails to start"
msgstr ""
"在飞行控制板上，编辑 /etc/init/q6.conf 脚本，注释掉以下这行——如果保留，当 "
"「q6」启动失败时，可能导致板子在启动过程中永久卡住。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:231
#: c792b22e75ee4d76a258856a0435023d
msgid ""
"``#watch -n 1 --precise -g grep -m 1 \"2\" "
"/sys/kernel/debug/msm_subsys/adsp && true``"
msgstr ""
"``#watch -n 1 --precise -g grep -m 1 \"2\" "
"/sys/kernel/debug/msm_subsys/adsp && true``"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:234
#: ca0327471b6643b895121e67f2224738
msgid "Putting the board in to \"Storage mode\""
msgstr "将板子置于「存储模式」"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:236
#: d61b68100c424d1bb7b6106dc69db71d
msgid ""
"During the upgrade process, if the above step is skipped, it is possible "
"to get the board into a state where it will not completely boot up.  You "
"will be unable to login using FTDI or wifi.  If this occurs you can "
"exploit a race condition in the startup sequence to get the board in "
"\"storage mode\" which allows accessing the disks on the board."
msgstr ""
"在升级过程中，如果跳过了上述步骤，板子可能进入无法完全启动的状态，也无法通过 FTDI 或 wifi "
"登录。此时可以利用启动序列中的竞争条件，将板子置于「存储模式」，从而访问板子上的磁盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:242
#: c33416afe88c4d7c989dd6ccfc45e2f7
msgid "first ensure both power and usb cables are disconnected"
msgstr "首先确保电源线和 USB 线均已断开"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:243
#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:246
#: 7efc66282aad425fba568ff6d8e45b41 a80c23e45a3e4984b727b717bdeda876
msgid "plug in the power"
msgstr "插入电源"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:244
#: 3446340afaff43fa89e3dc2badd92416
msgid "quickly plug in the usb"
msgstr "迅速插入 USB 线"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:245
#: 9e8b1e9fff24438cb8e07d1972946317
msgid "disconnect the power brick, hopefully the led will turn red"
msgstr "断开电源砖，此时 LED 有望变为红色"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:248
#: 7de2ab83f3b742319df454a60486ddb8
msgid ""
"If all goes well, 10 or 20 disk devices will appear on the Windows or "
"Ubuntu machine connected via USB.  The files on the disk can be edited "
"including perhaps editing the startup scripts to resolve the boot-up "
"issue."
msgstr ""
"若一切顺利，通过 USB 连接的 Windows 或 Ubuntu 机器上将出现 10 或 20 "
"个磁盘设备，可以编辑磁盘上的文件，包括修改启动脚本以解决启动问题。"

